'''Pink Strike''' (モモパワー, ''Momo Pawā'', '''Pink Power''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]].

==Effect==
Unit Speed UP (XL): [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers']] movement speeds increase by 30%.

==Requirement==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Pink Strike|Unit Speed Up (XL)|Ribbon Cat|jpname=モモパワー|restriction=Only [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]]}}
}}

==Trivia==
*Pink Strike, [[Blue Strike (Combo)|Blue Strike]] and [[Green Strike (Combo)|Green Strike]] are the first XL [[Cat Combo|Combos]] to not include any collab units.

